	render state structure to avoid setting to current value).
	(renderMaterial): if alpha < 0.0 for material, then enable
	GL_BLEND (if not already enabled), otherwise turn off GL_BLEND (if
	not already disabled). Preserve state in render state structure.
	(renderIFS): support colour-per-vertex polygons by enabling
	GL_SMOOTH, otherwise use GL_FLAT. Store the current shading mode
	in the render state to reduce state change calls.

