	  (length_v3f): New.  Computes the L2 norm of vector.
	  (length_v4f): New.  Computes the L2 norm of vector.
	  (normalize_v3f): New. Normalizes vector, returning original norm.
	  (normalize_v4f): New. Normalizes vector, returning original norm.
	  (identity_m4f): New. Creates and identity matrix.
	  (rotation_m4f): New. Creates a rotation matrix. r[3] is angle.

