	  matrices, passed as arguments.
	  (det_m3f, det_m4f): New. Compute determinants of m3f and m4f
	  matrices passed as pointers to structures.
	  (inverse_m4f): New. Compute the inverse of a 4x4 matrix.
	  (adjoint_m4f): New. Compute the adjoint of a 4x4 matrix.

