	  4x4 matrices and using this to solve Ax = b linear systems.

	  (ludecomp_m4f): New. Compute LU decomposition of m4f.
	  (lusub_m4f): New. Use LU decomposition to backsolve Ax = b.
	  (lusolve_m4f_v4f): New. Solve Ax = b using LU decomposition.

	* decompose.c: New file.  Decompose a transformation matrix into
	  translation, rotation and scale corresponding to entries in VRML
	  Transform node.
	
	  (extractP_m4f): New. Extract projection components from matrix,
	  leaving affine matrix.
	  (extractT_m4f): New. Extract translation components from affine
	  matrix, leaving scaled rotation.
	  (extractS_m4f): New. Extract scaling from scaled rotation
	  matrix, leaving rotation.
	  (extractR_m4f): New. Extract axis and angle description of
	  rotation from rotation matrix.
	  (decompose_m4f): New. Decompose a 4x4 transformation matrix into
	  sequence of rotation, scaling, translation, and projection.

